427
00:29:09.705 --> 00:29:13.012
R to O: bucket 532 on shard-c.

428
00:29:13.292 --> 00:29:14.167
O to A:

429
00:29:14.447 --> 00:29:21.785
BEGIN insert order ord214... bucket 532, items, payment intent, outbox row.

430
00:29:22.065 --> 00:29:22.940
A to O:

431
00:29:23.220 --> 00:29:25.609
COMMIT ok, one local transaction.

432
00:29:25.889 --> 00:29:26.807
O to C:

433
00:29:27.087 --> 00:29:35.599
201 ord2141a0de1f7a40df6a5d04.

434
00:29:35.879 --> 00:29:39.932
A to K: outbox relay publishes order.order.placed.v1.

435
00:29:40.212 --> 00:29:41.108
