00:30:10.513 --> 00:30:14.715
Sequence: failure path, a writer with a stale map during a bucket move.

444
00:30:14.995 --> 00:30:17.790
The sequence diagram walks through it step by step.

445
00:30:18.070 --> 00:30:21.270
M to S: bulk copy bucket 40 while writable.

446
00:30:21.550 --> 00:30:23.427
M to T: upsert rows.

447
00:30:23.707 --> 00:30:26.374
M to S: catch-up deltas until small.

448
00:30:26.654 --> 00:30:30.494
M to S: insert into bucketfence 40 movedto shard-e.

449
00:30:30.774 --> 00:30:35.361
W to S: insert order into bucket 40 using map v7.

450
00:30:35.641 --> 00:30:36.793
S to W:

451
00:30:37.073 --> 00:30:41.019
ERROR BUCKETMOVED bucket=40 movedto=shard-e.

452
00:30:41.299 --> 00:30:43.411
M to S: copy final delta.

453
00:30:43.691 --> 00:30:45.995
M to T: upsert final delta.

454
00:30:46.275 --> 00:30:48.899
M to M: checksum source equals target.

455
00:30:49.179 --> 00:30:52.998
M to CFG: set bucket 40 to shard-e, version 8.

456
00:30:53.278 --> 00:30:55.603
