459
00:31:01.990 --> 00:31:05.361
T to W: ok. and so on, as shown on screen.

460
00:31:09.211 --> 00:31:13.968
If the checksums don't match, the mover keeps the fence, doesn't flip the map, and pages.

461
00:31:14.248 --> 00:31:19.816
Writes to that one bucket fail until a human decides, which is better than silently losing them.

462
00:31:21.166 --> 00:31:23.129
State: one bucket during a move.

463
00:31:23.409 --> 00:31:24.753
Here is the diagram.

464
00:31:28.603 --> 00:31:30.416
Aborting is free until the fence.

465
