00:38:21.843 --> 00:38:22.525
8.

594
00:38:22.805 --> 00:38:23.957
Failure modes.

595
00:38:24.237 --> 00:38:27.288
Stale map writes: refused by the fence, retried.

596
00:38:27.568 --> 00:38:30.448
Checksum mismatch: fence kept, no flip, page.

597
00:38:30.728 --> 00:38:35.251
Mover crash mid-copy: restart from the watermark (idempotent upserts).

598
00:38:35.531 --> 00:38:39.968
A shard down: its buckets (~25 %) fail, the rest serve.

599
00:38:40.248 --> 00:38:43.683
Map store down: pods keep the cached map, and moves pause.

600
00:38:43.963 --> 00:38:46.843
Read model lag: the dashboard shows as of time.

601
00:38:47.123 --> 00:38:47.827
10.

602
00:38:48.107 --> 00:38:49.195
