603
00:38:49.475 --> 00:39:06.029
Requests and latency per shard and bucket (top-N hot buckets), shard skew (max or avg), map version per pod, BUCKETMOVED rate, mover progress or freeze time or checksum results, scatter-gather fan-out and partial-result rate, read model lag.

604
00:39:07.379 --> 00:39:08.233
14.

605
00:39:08.513 --> 00:39:14.379
Decision (ADR-041 or 042 or 043 summary).

606
00:39:14.659 --> 00:39:23.342
Orders are sharded at the application level by customerid into 1,024 fixed buckets mapped to shard clusters by a versioned map.

607
00:39:23.622 --> 00:39:25.414
Order ids carry their bucket.

608
00:39:25.694 --> 00:39:29.939
Store queries use an event-fed read model keyed by salted storeid.

609
00:39:30.219 --> 00:39:37.793
Buckets move online with bulk copy, catch-up, a DB-level write fence, checksum verification and a versioned map flip.

