1301
01:29:17.411 --> 01:29:20.205
Nodes join or leave automatically (caches):

1302
01:29:20.485 --> 01:29:22.363
Consistent hashing with vnodes.

1303
01:29:22.643 --> 01:29:24.776
Frequent queries on a non-shard key:

1304
01:29:25.056 --> 01:29:27.509
Event-fed read model (global index).

1305
01:29:27.789 --> 01:29:30.072
Rare admin queries on a non-shard key:

1306
01:29:30.352 --> 01:29:31.675
Bounded scatter-gather.

1307
01:29:31.955 --> 01:29:34.131
By-id lookup without the shard key:

1308
01:29:34.411 --> 01:29:36.117
Bucket encoded in the id.

1309
01:29:36.397 --> 01:29:37.699
One very hot key:

1310
01:29:37.979 --> 01:29:41.115
Salting (writes), caching (reads), dedicated shard.

1311
01:29:42.465 --> 01:29:43.894
Adding a shard online:

1312
01:29:44.174 --> 01:29:49.955
Copy, then catch up, then fence, then final delta, then verify, then flip, then delete later.

1313
01:29:50.235 --> 01:29:51.451
Want it built for you:

1314
